# Two dev machines (mac + Windows) share this checkout through git only.
# Without this file core.autocrlf=true gives Windows CRLF working copies while
# macOS keeps LF, so both sides see phantom modifications in the other's diffs.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gp5 binary
*.gp binary
*.gpx binary
*.mid binary
*.midi binary
*.wav binary
*.pdf binary
*.sf2 binary
*.sf3 binary
